{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f8bd0d9f-0d6a-8ee4-85c9-d71f8c7dd976",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T13:44:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:42:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:42:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Before anything else, what was your name again? I like to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tony Ferreira. F-E-R-R-E-I-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:42:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ferreira. Got it. Tony Ferreira, Tuesday, quarter to two. This is Dennis Cullen, 432 Farewell Street, up in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:42:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Cullen. What's going on with the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:42:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got a notice in the mail that my water and sewer payment was returned by my bank. Bounced. That's the second piece of paper I've gotten about it and nobody tells me anything. I want to know where it stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:43:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull it up. Give me a second. [pause] Okay, I see it. The payment from your bank came back unpaid, so the bill is showing as still open. Nothing has been added yet that I can see beyond the original balance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:43:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Open. So it's not paid. Let me write that down. And I'm not asking you to change anything, understand. I just want it explained to me, plainly, why it bounced and what I owe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:43:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I can see that it was returned, but I can't see the bank's reason. That would be on the notice from your bank. What I can tell you is the balance on the bill is what's owed until a new payment goes through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:43:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Now, my daughter helps me with the bills these days. She's the one who'd sort this out with the bank. How do I get her authorized to talk to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:43:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'd need something in writing from you naming her, with your signature and the account number. She can bring it in or mail it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:44:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In writing, signature, account number. Okay. She's got my grandson's hamster at her house for the break, a class pet, so she's been busy. Running around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:44:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That'll keep her hopping. Anything else I can look at for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:44:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's all I needed, Mr. Ferreira. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:44:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Cullen. Take care."
    }
  ],
